sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Admin
    participant FE as HROS Web
    participant API as UserGroupController
    participant Impact as ImpactAnalyzer
    participant UG as UserGroupModule
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Admin->>FE: Remove Role
    FE->>API: Preview removal

    API->>Impact: calculate affected members
    Impact->>DB: Read Group membership
    DB-->>Impact: affected population
    Impact-->>API: impact
    API-->>FE: Show impact

    Admin->>FE: Confirm
    FE->>API: Remove Role assignment

    API->>UG: removeRole()
    UG->>DB: Delete UserGroup-Role assignment
    UG->>DB: Increment User Group version

    Note over UG,DB: Role entity itself remains unchanged

    UG-->>API: PENDING
    API-->>FE: Pending synchronization
